Pct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="950" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="57534A"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>— the compliance target for a public-facing government portal.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="950" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="&#x2022;"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="950" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="16140E"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Andrew’s monotone-chain convex hull </a:t></a:r><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="950" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="57534A"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>— computes each project’s extent from its parcel points for the map view, with no geospatial dependency added.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="950" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="&#x2022;"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="950" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="16140E"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Supabase (managed PostgreSQL, Storage, Auth) and OpenStreetMap / Leaflet </a:t></a:r><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="500"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="950" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="57534A"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>— the deployment target the live adapter is written against, chosen so a district pilot needs no bespoke server operations.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="950" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="24" name="Shape 21"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6163056" y="4114800"/><a:ext cx="5614416" cy="2231136"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="roundRect"><a:avLst><a:gd name="adj" fmla="val 2459"/></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="16140E"/></a:solidFill><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="25" name="Text 22"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6419088" y="4334256"/><a:ext cx="5120640" cy="237744"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="900" b="1" spc="160" kern="0" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F3B44A"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>WHAT WE ARE BRINGING TO THE TABLE</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="26" name="Text 23"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6419088" y="4626864"/><a:ext cx="5120640" cy="1005840"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="110000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="D9D4C6"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Not a concept deck — a running system. Seven statutory stages, five role-scoped portals, an explainable risk queue, a tamper-evident ledger and a zero-login landowner portal, already working over 42 parcels across 5 projects and 5 states, on code that runs unchanged against in-memory data or PostgreSQL.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="27" name="Text 24"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6419088" y="5632704"/><a:ext cx="5120640" cy="548640"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F3B44A"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Every figure on these slides — the risk weights, the SLA thresholds, the document lists, the hash chain — is read out of the running code, not estimated for the deck.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>